hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1484","[AI-translation] Usama bin Zaid (raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Beshak ye takleef ya beemari (tao'on) aik azaab hai jis ke zariye tum se pehle baaz ummaton ko azaab diya gaya, phir wo zameen mein baaqi reh gaya, kabhi chala jata hai aur kabhi laut aata hai. To jo shakhs kisi zameen mein us ke honay ki khabar sunay to wahan na jaye, aur jo shakhs kisi zameen mein ho aur wahan ye (waba) phoot paray to us se bhaag kar (wahan se) na niklay. (Muslim: 7/28)"
"1485","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Umar bin Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) Shaam ki taraf niklay, yahan tak ke jab Sargh (naami jagah) par pahunche to un se lashkaron walay Abu Ubaida bin Jarrah aur un ke saathi milay aur unhon ne unhein khabar di ke Shaam mein waba phoot pari hai. Ibn Abbas ne kaha: To Umar ne kaha: Mere paas pehlay Muhajireen ko bulao. To main ne unhein bulaya, phir un se mashwara kiya aur unhein bataya ke Shaam mein waba phoot pari hai, to un mein ikhtilaf ho gaya. Baaz ne kaha: Aap aik kaam ke liye niklay hain aur ham nahi samajhtay ke Aap us se wapas paltein. Aur baaz ne kaha: Aap ke saath baqiya log aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sahaba hain aur ham nahi samajhtay ke Aap unhein is waba ki taraf le jayein. Unhon ne kaha: Mere paas se uth jao. Phir kaha: Mere paas Ansaar ko bulao. To main ne unhein bulaya, phir un se mashwara kiya to wo Muhajireen ke tareeqay par chalay aur unhi ki tarah ikhtilaf kiya. Unhon ne kaha: Mere paas se uth jao. Phir kaha: Mere paas unhein bulao jo yahan Quraish ke buzurgon mein se Fateh (Makka) ke waqt hijrat karnay walon mein se hain. To main ne unhein bulaya to un mein do aadmi ka bhi ikhtilaf na hua, unhon ne kaha: Ham ye rai detay hain ke Aap logon ko le kar wapas laut jayein aur unhein is waba ki taraf na le jayein. To Umar ne logon mein elaan kiya: Main subah sawari par (wapas) rawaana honay wala hun, to tum bhi subah us par ho jao. To Abu Ubaida bin Jarrah ne kaha: Kya Allah ki taqdeer se bhaag kar? To Umar ne kaha: Ae Abu Ubaida! Kaash tumharay siwa koi aur ye kehta. Aur Umar un ki mukhalfat ko napasand kartay thay. (Unhon ne kaha:) Haan, ham Allah ki taqdeer se Allah hi ki taqdeer ki taraf bhaagtay hain. Batao, agar tumharay paas oont hon aur tum aik waadi mein utro jis ke do kinaray hon, aik sarsabz aur doosra khushk, to kya aisa nahi ke agar tum sarsabz mein charao ge to Allah ki taqdeer se charao ge aur agar khushk mein charao ge to Allah ki taqdeer se charao ge? Unhon ne kaha: Phir Abdur Rahman bin Auf aaye aur wo apni kisi zaroorat ki wajah se ghair haazir thay, to unhon ne kaha: Beshak mere paas is baaray mein ilm hai, main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmatay hue suna: Jab tum kisi zameen mein us (waba) ke honay ki khabar suno to wahan na jao, aur jab kisi zameen mein ye phoot paray aur tum wahan ho to us se bhaag kar na niklo. Unhon ne kaha: To Umar bin Khattab ne Allah ki hamd ki, phir wapas laut gaye. (Muslim: 7/29-30). (1) Sargh Shaam ke kinaray Hijaaz ki taraf aik gaon hai. (2) Yani subah safar kar ke Madina wapas janay wala hun. (3) Yani do kinaray."
